Recommends: secubox-sentinelle-gsm (>= 0.4)
Description: SecuBox FM Relay — rtl_fm to Icecast MP3 mount with live RDS metadata
 Captures FM broadcast audio with rtl_fm, encodes it to MP3 with ffmpeg
 (libmp3lame), and feeds an Icecast2 mount that the SecuBox webradio
 module serves and that Lyrion can ingest as a Favourite remote URL.
 .
 A parallel rtl_fm | redsea pipeline decodes the 57 kHz RDS subcarrier
 (PI / PS / RT) and POSTs each RadioText update to Icecast2's admin
 metadata endpoint so HTTP listeners see "Artist - Title" change live
 in their player.
 .
 Shares the RTL-SDR with secubox-sentinelle-gsm. Don't run a GSM scan
 or RDS sweep while a relay is active — the bus contention will crash
 both. Cross-package device-claim coordination is a planned v0.2
 follow-up.
